<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Swedish paper basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Swedish paper basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation (Stockholm) has issued five million American-style call warrants, on a Swedish paper basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share each of Mo och Dumsjo AB, Svenska Cellulosa AB, AssiDomain AB and Sfora Koppberg AB shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    730 SEK		   PREMIUM	17.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.10DEM		   GEARING	57.5 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 9.NOV.96-22.JUN.98    PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  632 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
